{"id": "t108-049", "text": "kavya's first day at the new school went badly, the year 9s were a nightmare and someone set off the fire alarm. shes going to stick with it but sounded close to tears. her husband Darius is away on a work trip till thursday so shes on her own with the kids. message her friday to see if the week got better, maybe offer to have the little ones saturday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day at the new school", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "close to tears", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "work trip", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to have the little ones", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little ones", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "saturday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t108-050", "text": "Abebe's son starts uni in Glasgow next Sunday, doing engineering. The whole family's driving him up on Saturday, then his wife is staying an extra few days to settle him in. Abebe says he's fine about it but he went very quiet when I asked. Also mentioned work want him to move to the Leeds site in the new year. Lot going on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Glasgow", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing engineering", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to the Leeds site", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}]}
